    "question": {
      ":question/id": "16f98c04-c89a-5e4f-bf27-ed015bececed",
      ":question/problem": "Find ${f}^{\u2032}(x)$ if $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}+2tan\u2061x.$\n\n${f}^{\u2032}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan\u2061x)={sec}^{2}\u2061x.$ Applying these formulas, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}+2tan\u2061x) \\\\  & =1\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x})+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan\u2061x) \\\\  & =1(\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}})+2({sec}^{2}\u2061x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{\\sqrt{x}}+2{sec}^{2}\u2061x.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "c9aa3437-62e4-5f8b-b2f8-54736d53760f",
